rsation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Sorry. This is going to sound odd."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Is this still your number?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Who's asking?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Fair question."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm Sophie."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And that probably doesn't help much."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I don't expect you to know me."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I found this number saved somewhere."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Can I explain?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Go ahead."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Thank you."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"It's a saved copy of someone's contacts."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"The file says it belongs to Daniel Mercer."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I was looking through it earlier."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Your number is in there."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"No name beside it."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Just a star."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"A star?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Yeah. Like a favourite, maybe."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"But I don't know what that symbol means in this file."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Do you know Daniel?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Daniel Mercer?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"No. Never heard the name."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Okay."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That was the most likely answer, I suppose."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Could you think back a little?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Even an old online chat. A work message. Anything."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm not asking you to guess."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"I'm sure I haven't spoken to him."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Then that's useful to know."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I thought if I asked, the answer might be simple."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"“Oh, yeah. Daniel and I used to work together.”"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Something like that."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Sorry. I'm talking as if you already know what's happened."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Then tell me."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Right."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Daniel stopped replying."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Messages. Calls."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"For days now."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"At first we thought he was busy."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Then we thought maybe he wanted space."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I don't know what to think anymore."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Have you tried checking on him in person?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"We have tried to check he's safe."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I don't want to give you a version of events I'm not sure about."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm sorry. I should've said that sooner."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"You don't owe me your time."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I haven't even asked what to call you."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"You can call me Alex."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Alex. Got it."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Nice to meet you. In a very odd way."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"You know what's strange?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I nearly deleted this number."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I had my finger over it and everything."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"What changed your mind?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I kept thinking: what if this is the one person who can tell us something ordinary and useful?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I didn't want to start believing the star meant something just because I was scared."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"But I didn't want to delete the question either."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"There are other people trying to find him."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Some of us are talking in a group."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Well, arguing in a group, lately."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Who's in it?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"People close to him."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I can introduce you properly if you decide to join."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I haven't told them I've been messaging you."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"They knew about the number. Not that I would actually contact it."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm going to get an earful."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Then maybe talk to them first."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That's probably the sensible thing."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Sensible hasn't been my strongest quality this week."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Could I ask you something slightly unreasonable?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Would you consider joining the chat?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Only to listen at first. If you want."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I don't need you to promise you'll solve anything."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Why would I be any use?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"You can tell us what you do and don't recognise."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That alone might stop us making up stories around your number."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Look, you can say no."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I won't turn it into some kind of test."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"But if you join, there are people who'll want to ask you questions."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"One in particular."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Alright. Send it."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Okay."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Thank you."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Fair warning."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"The group isn't exactly having its finest week."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"If someone comes across as rude, please don't assume everyone feels the same way."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"I can handle a rude person."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I hope so."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I know one who could give lessons."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I should tell them first."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Actually, if I overthink this I'll never do it."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Hey. You got a minute?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Hey."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm sorry about earlier."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Not because Lucas disagreed with me."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I knew he would."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Because I put you in the middle of it."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I could actually feel myself making it worse and somehow kept talking."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Impressive, really."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"That was a lot for a first meeting."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Yeah."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"We usually try to save the group meltdown for the second meeting."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Sorry. Bad joke."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"There's something I should've told you before I invited you."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Daniel isn't just someone I'm trying to find."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He's my brother."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"My older brother."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That's why I couldn't leave the contact list alone."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I wasn't trying to trick you into joining us."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I just kept thinking: what if this is the one person I don't ask?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Daniel is your brother?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Yeah."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I should've led with that."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"It's funny."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I've spent so much time saying his name lately."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Daniel did this. Daniel said that. Has anyone heard from Daniel?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I haven't told you what he's actually like."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Which is a strange thing to realise when he's the person I've known longest."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Tell me about him."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That's a harder question than it should be."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He's thoughtful. And unbelievably annoying."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He'll spend an entire afternoon fixing something that would've been cheaper to replace."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Then he'll act offended if you suggest it was a waste of time."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"It's not always easy being his sister."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"But it is very rarely boring."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"He sounds stubborn."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Incredibly."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He'd give you a twenty-minute lecture on why he isn't."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And whenever he gets busy, he says the same thing."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"“I'll explain later.”"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"It's become a joke between us."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"It used to be funny."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Sorry. That sounds more dramatic than I meant it to."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I was going to tell you a better story."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"One year he told me he couldn't make it to my birthday."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He said he was working late."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I was furious."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Then he turned up after dinner with a cake."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"The icing had slid to one side."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Half of “Happy Birthday” was stuck to the inside of the box."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He looked so proud of it. 😭"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"The cake was leaning. Somehow he was the one acting offended when I laughed."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"It's the thought that counts."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That's exactly what he said!"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I swear he practised that line in the car."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That's the part I keep thinking about."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Daniel always turned up eventually."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Late, usually. With a terrible excuse."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"But he turned up."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And now I can't get him to answer one message."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Sorry."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"You didn't come here to be sad with me."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"How long has it been?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"A few days without a proper answer."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I keep counting them like it'll change something."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I've been rereading our last chat."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I know it isn't going to grow a new message if I stare long enough."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Doesn't stop me."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I still know where the conversation ends. Every time I open it."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I keep expecting to be wrong."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"What did he say?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Nothing dramatic."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Normal things. That's almost worse."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"There's somebody else I worry about just as much."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Maya."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"You met her at a pretty terrible moment."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She's usually the one with a plan."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And a backup plan if the plan goes wrong."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She also remembers to feed the rest of us."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Which probably sounds like a small thing."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Lately it's not."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Why is this so personal for her?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She's Daniel's fiancée."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"They were planning a wedding."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Maya Chen."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That's her full name, by the way."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She's frighteningly good at spreadsheets."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Daniel once said dating her was like having an extremely attractive project manager."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He said that in front of her."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He was lucky to survive dinner."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I can still hear her saying, \"I am not managing you as a project, Daniel.\""]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He said, \"Well, the results speak for themselves.\""]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And she threw a napkin at him."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Did they seem happy together?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"As far as I could tell, yes."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I wasn't there for every private conversation, though."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"You probably noticed she deleted a message."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"In the group."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She's been very strict about not calling guesses facts."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She said she was trying to put a guess into words and couldn't stand behind it."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I only know that because she said it in the chat."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I didn't see what she'd deleted."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Did you see what it said?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"No."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And I won't pretend I did."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And Lucas..."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Where do I even start with Lucas?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He and Daniel have known each other since they were kids."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Lucas used to come over so often my mum stopped asking if he was staying for dinner."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She just put out another plate."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He'd complain about being treated like family."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Then turn up the next day anyway."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I don't know when the arguing stopped being the fun kind."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"He sounded very protective."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He is."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"His timing needs work. So does his delivery."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He and Daniel used to fight about music."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And football."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And things neither of them had the slightest idea about."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Then they'd share a pizza an hour later."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I think what's hurting Lucas is that Daniel isn't here for them to argue with."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Do you think he'll come back?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I hope so."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"He left a chat. I don't think he stopped caring."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"There is someone you haven't really met yet."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Eli."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She doesn't usually say much in the group."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Then she'll respond to a question from six hours ago like it was posted five seconds ago."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"It's oddly impressive."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She once answered a question two days late with \"Technically, no,\" and nothing else."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"We had to ask her which question she meant."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Who is she?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Eli Ward."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She works with Daniel at Axiom Recovery."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She knows much more about Daniel's work than I do."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm the person who calls tech support and says, “the thing won't do the thing.”"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"What's Axiom Recovery?"]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Where Daniel works."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"They do data recovery and related technical work."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"That's about as far as my expertise goes."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"So that's Maya, Lucas and Eli."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"In the least useful introduction tour imaginable."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"They have one thing in common."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"They want Daniel back."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And they disagree about almost everything else."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I guess that's what happens when you ask five people to be scared in exactly the same way."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line outgoing chat-group-start chat-group-end"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble player"},"Maya seems the easiest to talk to."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-start chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"She's good at making people feel heard."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Unless she's very tired. Then the sarcasm comes out."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"Including what I say about myself."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm not some impartial narrator here."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm his sister."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-open"},["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"And right now I want anything that might bring him home to mean something."]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-line incoming chat-group-continuation chat-group-end"},["SPAN",{"class":"chat-contact-avatar"},["SPAN",{"class":"character-avatar message-avatar","aria-hidden":"true"},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"http://127.0.0.1:4200/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","src":"/media/portraits/sophie-avatar.webp"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"conversation-body"},["DIV",{"class":"opening-bubble sophie"},"I'm glad you stayed, Alex."]]],["BUTTON",{"class":"chat-group-action"},"Open FIND DANIEL →"]],["DIV",{"class":"opening-actions opening-v4-composer"},["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-primary"},"TELL SOPHIE ABOUT THE MESSAGE"],["BUTTON",{"class":"opening-choice"},"KEEP IT TO YOURSELF"]]]],[[3,56]]]]],[[9,59]],[[9,60]]]],"viewport":{"width":412,"height":839},"timestamp":70258.456,"wallTime":1800001623766,"collectionTime":6,"resourceOverrides":[],"isMainFrame":true}}
